OL,3,AUS rapper BigXthaPlug arrested on drug
OL,4,Aand gun charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FDallas rapper BigXthaPlug has been
OL,7,Farrested in the US state of Texas on
OL,8,Fcharges of driving while intoxicated,
OL,9,Fpossession of marijuana and illegal
OL,10,Fpossession of a firearm.
OL,12,FAllen County Police confirmed to BBC
OL,13,FNewsbeat the 28-year-old, whose real
OL,14,Fname is Xavier Landum, was stopped on
OL,15,FFriday. He is being held in Collin
OL,16,FCounty Jail.
OL,18,FHe was on bail, following an arrest on
OL,19,Fsimilar charges a year ago.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
